/*

| Algorithm                  | When to use           |
| -------------------------- | --------------------- |
| Fixed Window               | Simple internal tools |
| Sliding Window Log         | Strict accuracy       |
| Sliding Window Counter     | Best balance          |
| Token Bucket               | APIs / burst handling |
